#AREA Midnight Mansion~ 
#AUTHORS Tex~ 
#RESETMSG Darkness covers the face of the earth as evil laughter echoes in your ears.~
 
#HELPS
-1 'MIDNIGHT MANSION' MIDNIGHT MANSION~
MIDNIGHT MANSION
----------------

The area around the Midnight Mansion might once have been healthy and
thriving, but if it was then it was centuries ago.  From the castle,
you can just barely see Phoenix Peak off to the north, while if you look
to the west you can see the sun glinting of the Gulf of the East.  In the
Centuries since its fall however, Midnight Mansion has been cut off from
most avenues of entrance and is now only accessable though a single road.

This area was created by Mancha and was last updated on 9 April 2001
~
0 $~
 
