#18120 
book spell spellbook~ 
the ancient spellbook~ 
The ancient book of mage's spells collects dust on the ground. ~ 
The book is ancient indeed as the pages are torn and yellowed.  Most of the 
spells you cannot make out the words on the page, but there are a few that 
are of particular interest.  Looking in the index you see a list of spells 
that might be of interest. 
~ 
