A 
APPLY_MANA 160
A
APPLY_AC -10
E 
index~ 
You read the index of the ancient spellbook: 
 
  IV  - Bin de Chaos aun atem 
  V   - Lem podere de Order
  XII - Aaar aogi aeugau qoirn
  XX  - Creton of tavs
  XV  - Illgo eun des vargotia
~ 
E
XV~
The spell is completely incomprehensible.
~
E
XX~
Turning to page XX in the ancient spellbook, you read:

  CREATION OF STAVES

The creation of a staff is a very personal thing and requires that the
user be somewhat evil.  Due to the nature of the ingredients needed for 
this staff, good-hearted people may shy away from making it.  Too bad
for them.

Ingredients:
Seed of Discord
A stick
Glob of water
Zombie skin
Skeleton bone
Erlenmeyer flask

Procedure:
  I. Grind the Seed of Discord and place it in the Erlenmeyer flask
 II. Splinter the bone into chips and place them in the flask
III. Fill the flask with water
 IV. Heat the solution to boiling over a fireplace
  V. Stretch the zombie skin over the stick
 VI. Pour the solution over the zombie stick
VII. Recite the following incantation:
       "The waking dead, the dead to waking
        Breaking harmony and harmony broken
        This power to you-the one to taking
        And sealing it with words so spoken"
~
E 
IV~ 
Turning to page IV in the ancient spellbook, you read: 
 
  BINDING THE POWER OF CHAOS TO AN ITEM 

Binding the power of Chaos to a weapon requires a weapon of heros.
In the darkest of hours you must pray to your god that he will
show you favor and bind himself to your weapon.
~ 
E 
V~ 
Turning to page V in the ancient spellbook, you read: 
 
  BINDING THE POWER OF ORDER TO AN ITEM 

To bind the power of Order to a weapon, you must start with a weapon
of heros.  It can be made of anything but must be unsullied by the
taint of dishonor.  Pray to your god when the sun is the brightest 
and if he shows you favor he will bind himself to your weapon.
~ 
E 
XII~ 
The rest of the book is incomprehensable to you. 
~
