>death_prog 80~ 
if class($n) == 5 
  mpoload 18119 
  mpquiet on
    drop i18119
  mpquiet off
endif 
~ 
>give_prog i18119~ 
mpjunk all
emote looks at the meat cleaver in wonder.
say You killed me before, and yet you are returning my favored meat cleaver.  Why?
mpechoat $n You start to reply, but are cut short. 
mpechoaround $n $n looks as though $e is about to reply but the cook resumes. 
say No, I don't need to know.  However, since you have been so kind to me, I will in return be kind to you.  This meat cleaver can only be enchanted by a spell which only I know.  Once I have invoked the spell, I can then give you the cleaver and the spel
l will remain in full effect. It is the least I can do for you.' 
mpoload 18100 
give i18100 $n 
thank $n 
mppurge $i
~
