#18103 
queen lovely~ 
the queen~ 
The lovely queen cries softly to herself.~ 
With bleary eyes she watches as you examine her.  She is sorrowful, for some 
unknown reason.  If there were a way to help her, she would be much happier. 
~ 
ACT_RACE|ACT_UNDEAD|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES -500 S 
99 BODY_HAND BODY_HEAD 12d544+5938 10d14+10 
1247563 RACE_HUMAN 
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE 
>rand_prog 3~
mpecho The queen crys softly to herself.
~
>speech_prog p I am trustworthy~
if quest(31,5,$n) > 2
  if quest(15,1,$n) == 0
    mpechoat $n The queen ponders your worth.
    if isevil($n)
      mpoload 18113
      mpquiet on
        give i18113 $n
      mpquiet off
      mpechoat $n The queen secretly gives you the Seed of Discord.
      tell $n My lover told me to give this to one who would help.  I do not know what it's purpose is...you should go ask him.
      say Fare thee well, $n
      mpmset $n quest 15 1 1
    else
      tell $n No, I'm afraid you aren't trustworthy enough.
    endif
    mpecho The queen fades from view. 
    if hasobjnum(18109)
      mpjunk i18109 
      mpoload 18101
      mpquiet on
        drop i18101
      mpquiet off
    endif
    mppurge $i
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p the wizard~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 2
  glare $n
  say Don't talk to me, I'm too upset!
endif
~
>give_prog i18108~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 2
  open locket 
  get picture locket 
  if hasobjnum(18109) 
    mpecho The queen gazes longingly at the picture. 
    look $n 
    say Thank you, $n, for returning my locket. 
    smile 
    tell $n I have a secret...but I feel I can trust you.
    tell $n You want to know about the wizard, right?
    mpforce $n reply Yes
    mpechoat $n The queen glances about the room.
    tell $n He shares my bed, but the king does not know.
    tell $n My husband is a fool...without his Iron Fist he cannot rule this nation.
    tell $n You must help us de-throne him!
    say Are you trustwory?
    mpmset $n quest 31 5 3
  else
    scream 
    say My picture!  My precious picture!! 
    growl $n 
    shout $n is a bloody thief! 
    mpkill $n 
  endif 
else
  mpecho The queen fades from view.
  mpjunk i18108
  mppurge $i
endif
~ 
>give_prog i18109~ 
if quest(31,5,$n) == 2
  say Where did you get this picture?! 
  shout $n is a bloody thief! 
  mpjunk i18109
  mpkill $n 
endif
~ 
| 
