>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say You are helping the wizard?
endif
~
>speech_prog p zombie skin~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  growl $n
  say Don't even THINK about it...I barely have any skin left!
endif
~
>speech_prog p skeleton bone~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say Find a skeleton, take a bone
endif
~
>speech_prog p erlenmeyer flask~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say Dunno about that one
endif
~
>speech_prog p yes~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say Very well, I suppose I can help...though you did dig up those graves.
  say Of all the items you need, which can I help you find?
endif
~
>speech_prog p a stick~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say A blue rose, if planted in dirt with plenty of sunshine, will grow into a bush at your command.
endif
~
>speech_prog p glob of water~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say Think about it...where can you find water?
endif
~
>speech_prog p seed of discord~
if quest(31,5,$n) == 4
  say Uh...don't you already have it?
endif
~
>rand_prog 15~
  if quest(31,5,$r) == 1
    say If you wish to help the royal family, I will give you a shovel and you can dig up their graves.
  endif
~
>speech_prog why~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say Don't ask why, kid
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p wish to help the royal family~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    if sex($n) == 1
      say Very noble, good Sir
    else 
      if sex($n) == 2
        say Very noble, fair Maiden
      else
        say Very noble...um...whatever you are
      endif
    endif
    say Take this shovel and dig up their graves
    say You realize, of course, this goes against everything in me that is a gardener...but if you must, do it and leave me alone
    mpoload 18105
    give i18105 $n
    mpmset $n quest 31 5 2
  endif
~
>speech_prog p tell me about the royal family~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 0
    say Ah yes, the royal family.
    chuckle
    mpmset $n quest 31 5 1
    say Well, of whom do you wish me to speak?
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the king~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say The King, you ask...
    say 'Tis a sad story indeed, if you will indulge me
    say The king used to be a noble man, who ruled with an Iron Fist
    say However, he lost that Fist when he discovered that his wizard...
    say Um...perhaps I shouldn't divulge that information.
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the queen~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say She got involved in something which I dare not speak.
    say I suggest you talk to her directly if you want to know.
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the wizard~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say Heh, the wizard...
    say He was the most powerful wizard in the land, but he had an evil streak in him
    say His evil and mischief caused the downfall of the king
    say And to forstall the predictable "Why?" question, all I am allowed to say is you should ask the queen to tell you about the wizard
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the princess~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say Oh!  The princess was the most adorable little thing you could ever see!
    say She used to come to my garden and gaze lovingly at the flowers.
    giggle
    say Her and her doll, that is.  She never went anywhere without it
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the prince~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say Shhh! Don't speak too loudly of the prince.
    emote shudders.
    say The king would have you beheaded if you reminded him of how his oldest and only son ran off to a foreign land with part of his inheritance and squandered it
    say That's not the worst part, though.  He also stole his mother's beloved picture of the princess and the king...right out of her locket!
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the cook~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say There's not much to say about the cook.
    say He did have this meat cleaver, never let it out of his sight.
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
>speech_prog p the gardener~
  if quest(31,5,$n) == 1
    say I'm flattered that you want to know about me, but I'll tell you a secret
    say None of the ghosts know they are dead.
    say Apparently only I realize this because I became a zombie...don't ask how, I don't know.  All I can say is, be careful as you walk around...they are acting as if they are alive.
  else
    say Go away, don't bother me
  endif
~
|
